WEBVTT

00:40:57.442 --> 00:41:01.545
we see those who control
a lot of resources

00:41:01.569 --> 00:41:03.585
being able to make contributions.

00:41:03.927 --> 00:41:08.679
We're giving 60,000 computers
to poor students,

00:41:08.703 --> 00:41:10.744
so that they can learn.

00:41:10.768 --> 00:41:14.941
You know, the difference
between a rich and a poor student

00:41:14.965 --> 00:41:18.046
is having a computer
and having the ability to learn.

00:41:18.480 --> 00:41:23.403
And I want to thank
those who would be embarrassed

00:41:23.427 --> 00:41:25.116
and almost afraid to hear it

00:41:25.140 --> 00:41:27.696
of how they contributed to that process.

00:41:27.720 --> 00:41:31.062
And at the same time, those other people,